      "value": "Whenever you try to upload an avatar or world, it always \"plays\" or simulates the scene. You can see the \"Play, Pause, Next Frame\" buttons in the top-middle area in Unity's layout.\n\nNext time it comes up with that error, just try to un-pause the scene once or twice. It should let you name and upload your avatar/world afterward.",
